{"url": "https://www.last.fm/music/Hozier/_/Sedated", "tags": [], "wiki": {"content": ""Sedated" is a song by recorded by Irish singer-songwriter Hozier for his 2014 eponymous debut studio album. It was released on 20 May 2014 as the third single from the record. The song peaked at number five on the Billboard Alternative Airplay Chart and  at number three on the Irish Singles Chart.

"Sedated" is an indie-rock song listed as the eighth track on the album, written by Hozier alone. "Sedated" contains stripped-back instrumentation with uplifting piano, gospel choir melodies, and rich, dark vocals while the lyrics depict an "addictive love", warning of "creeping shadows, poison, and personal decay". <a href="http://www.last.fm/music/Hozier/_/Sedated">Read more on Last.fm</a>. User-contributed text is available under the Creative Commons By-SA License; additional terms may apply.", "summary": ""Sedated" is a song by recorded by Irish singer-songwriter Hozier for his 2014 eponymous debut studio album. It was released on 20 May 2014 as the third single from the record. The song peaked at number five on the Billboard Alternative Airplay Chart and  at number three on the Irish Singles Chart.

