{"url": "https://www.last.fm/music/Fleet+Foxes/_/Quiet+Houses", "tags": [], "wiki": {"content": ""Quiet Houses" was the first song that the Fleet Foxes' principal songwriter Robin Pecknold wrote that showcased the band's celestial four-part harmonies. He explained to the London Times on June 20, 2008: "Prior to that, there were a few songs we were working on that were very much focused on the lead vocal, you know? And I wanted to do a song that was the extreme opposite of that - where the vocals were just part of the music and not just a platform for this guy."

The painting on the album cover is Netherlandish Proverbs by Pieter Bruegel the Elder (1525-1569). This humorous portrait of peasant life depicts around 100 literal renditions of Flemish proverbs of the day. Robin Pecknold explained to Q Magazine in August 2008 why they chose this particular piece of art for the album cover:

"I like it because it's very bucolic and pretty at first glance, but there's all this weird stuff going on-fires, people defecating coins, guys shearing pigs, dogs playing cards with chickens. It gets more disturbing the more you look at it- a pretty good analogy for our music." <a href="http://www.last.fm/music/Fleet+Foxes/_/Quiet+Houses">Read more on Last.fm</a>. User-contributed text is available under the Creative Commons By-SA License; additional terms may apply.", "summary": ""Quiet Houses" was the first song that the Fleet Foxes' principal songwriter Robin Pecknold wrote that showcased the band's celestial four-part harmonies. He explained to the London Times on June 20, 2008: "Prior to that, there were a few songs we were working on that were very much focused on the lead vocal, you know? And I wanted to do a song that was the extreme opposite of that - where the vocals were just part of the music and not just a platform for this guy." <a href="http://www.last.fm/music/Fleet+Foxes/_/Quiet+Houses">Read more on Last.fm</a>.", "published": "04 Nov 2022, 19:59"}, "title": "Quiet Houses", "album_name": "Fleet Foxes", "artist_name": "Fleet Foxes", "duration_ms": 212000, "album_images": ["https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/34s/e653fc9c0d474be1b6d007a6588b02c9.png", "https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/64s/e653fc9c0d474be1b6d007a6588b02c9.png", "https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/174s/e653fc9c0d474be1b6d007a6588b02c9.png", "https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/300x300/e653fc9c0d474be1b6d007a6588b02c9.png"], "provider_mbid": "06c9a98d-ff97-351a-9b68-dd49c72f0865", "provider_track_id": null}

