{"url": "https://www.last.fm/music/Tate+McRae/_/Just+Keep+Watching+(From+F1%C2%AE+The+Movie)", "tags": ["égera", "electropop", "victor", "Soundtrack", "Formula 1"], "wiki": {"content": ""Just Keep Watching" is a song by singer Tate McRae, it released on May 30, 2025 as the fourth single from the soundtrack album of the 2025 sports drama film F1. The song is a pop & "fast-moving" club track, set to match the "high energy" of the film featuring a "driving beat" during the chorus, it features a "quick-twitch percussion" predestined for McRae's signature "kinetic choreography". The track marks a collaboration with producers Tyler Spry and Ryan Tedder. McRae was revealed to be part of the soundtrack album on May 1, 2025. It was later chosen to be the theme song for Sky Sports' new look F1 coverage, beginning with the 2026 season.

The song's music video, directed by Bardia Zeinali, premiered on McRae's YouTube channel on May 30, 2025. A nod to the 1978 film Grease, it features McRae strutting down a "wind-blown runway" & posing next to stacks of tires, alternating with dance-heavy sequences with onlookers dressed in racing attires. The visuals include cuts from the film.

Just Keep Watching debuted at it's peak of #33 on the Billboard Hot 100 on the week of June 14, 2025. It peaked at #8 on the Billboard Global 200 & became McRae's third #1 song on the US Hot Dance/Pop Songs chart. The song earned Tate her first Grammy Award nomination for Best Dance Pop Recording. <a href="http://www.last.fm/music/Tate+McRae/_/Just+Keep+Watching+(From+F1%C2%AE+The+Movie)">Read more on Last.fm</a>. User-contributed text is available under the Creative Commons By-SA License; additional terms may apply.", "summary": ""Just Keep Watching" is a song by singer Tate McRae, it released on May 30, 2025 as the fourth single from the soundtrack album of the 2025 sports drama film F1. The song is a pop & "fast-moving" club track, set to match the "high energy" of the film featuring a "driving beat" during the chorus, it features a "quick-twitch percussion" predestined for McRae's signature "kinetic choreography". The track marks a collaboration with producers Tyler Spry and Ryan Tedder. <a href="http://www.last.fm/music/Tate+McRae/_/Just+Keep+Watching+(From+F1%C2%AE+The+Movie)">Read more on Last.fm</a>.", "published": "08 Sep 2026, 04:02"}, "title": "Just Keep Watching (From F1® The Movie)", "album_name": "Just Keep Watching (From F1® The Movie)", "artist_name": "Tate McRae", "duration_ms": 142000, "album_images": ["https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/34s/c3ed5bac4c4c523f4ee28e6318ce24d7.png", "https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/64s/c3ed5bac4c4c523f4ee28e6318ce24d7.png", "https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/174s/c3ed5bac4c4c523f4ee28e6318ce24d7.png", "https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/300x300/c3ed5bac4c4c523f4ee28e6318ce24d7.png"], "provider_mbid": "df1bd13a-0527-4bc2-b19c-29acedfaf065", "provider_track_id": null}

