{"url": "https://www.last.fm/music/Noah+Kahan/_/Staying+Still", "tags": [], "wiki": {"content": "“Staying Still” is one of four bonus tracks released by Noah Kahan on the extended version of his fourth studio album, The Great Divide: The Last Of The Bugs, that was debuted live at the Busyhead Project and Red Sox Foundation benefit concert held at MGM Fenway in Boston, MA on November 20, 2025. Kahan noted that the track pays homage to his hatred of driving to Logan Airport.

