ed+1994">Read more on Last.fm</a>.", "published": "08 Jan 2025, 19:55"}, "album": {"url": "https://www.last.fm/music/Artisti+Vari/Golf+Hits", "image": [{"size": "small", "#text": "https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/34s/a1340822413fca5aa9f66cac64e9ebc4.png"}, {"size": "medium", "#text": "https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/64s/a1340822413fca5aa9f66cac64e9ebc4.png"}, {"size": "large", "#text": "https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/174s/a1340822413fca5aa9f66cac64e9ebc4.png"}, {"size": "extralarge", "#text": "https://lastfm-img.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/300x300/a1340822413fca5aa9f66cac64e9ebc4.png"}], "title": "Golf Hits", "artist": "Artisti Vari"}, "artist": {"url": "https://www.last.fm/music/The+Rolling+Stones", "mbid": "b071f9fa-14b0-4217-8e97-eb41da73f598", "name": "The Rolling Stones"}, "toptags": {"tag": [{"url": "https://www.last.fm/tag/blues+rock", "name": "blues rock"}, {"url": "https://www.last.fm/tag/classic+rock", "name": "classic rock"}, {"url": "https://www.last.fm/tag/soul", "name": "soul"}, {"url": "https://www.last.fm/tag/pop+rock", "name": "pop rock"}, {"url": "https://www.last.fm/tag/remaster", "name": "remaster"}]}, "duration": "265000", "listeners": "491348", "playcount": "3591805", "streamable": {"#text": "0", "fulltrack": "0"}}}

